[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0060","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49635","title":"Linux kernel drm/i915 自测程序减法溢出越界写入漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Intel 核显驱动（drm/i915）的内存管理中存在整数溢出漏洞。当 hole_end 值过小时进行减法运算会导致下溢出，同时 (addr + 2 * min_alignment) 计算在模拟测试场景中也可能发生上溢出，进而触发越界写入内存（CWE-787）。攻击者可通过诱导系统执行特定内存分配操作利用此漏洞，导致系统崩溃或本地权限提升。该漏洞影响使用 Intel 显卡的 Linux 内核系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49635"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:42Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.19 及以上版本，或更新至包含提交 ab3edc679c55 的 LTS 版本（5.15.58+、5.10.136+、5.4.210+）。如无法立即更新内核，可通过 git cherry-pick ab3edc679c55 手动应用补丁到 drivers/gpu/drm/i915/selftests/i915_gem_gtt.c 文件并重新编译内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/333991c4e66b3d4b5613315f18016da80344f659","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e8997d2d6b8d764e12489f1af2a1ce1d7384ca2a","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49635.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49635.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49635","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49635.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49635.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-6rj2-mg6v-3gwc/GHSA-6rj2-mg6v-3gwc.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49635.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49635","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5fc355d60e5d1a1fefefacd0202b767223ed6ef1/usn/8163-1.json","https://github.com/fderuiter/lambda-wave/blob/352d151151b3004e320d909f59dc8b1fa30f2838/.trivyignore"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0059","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49622","title":"Linux Kernel netfilter nf_tables NF_STOLEN 处理时使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netfilter 子系统中的 nf_tables 模块存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当 netfilter 规则处理返回 NF_STOLEN 判定时，对应的 skb（套接字缓冲区）可能已被释放，但追踪（tracing）功能仍会访问已释放的 skb 中的 nf_trace、mark 等字段，导致释放后使用。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 netfilter 规则触发此条件，利用该漏洞实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49622"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:39Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.137、5.15.61、5.19.17 及以上长期支持版本，或向后移植提交 afc20184c76f (\"netfilter: nf_tables: avoid skb access on nf_stolen\") 至当前内核源码树。如无法立即升级，可在未打补丁的系统上临时禁用 netfilter 的 nftables 追踪功能（nf_tables trace），降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0016d5d46d7440729a3132f61a8da3bf7f84e2ba","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e34b9ed96ce3b06c79bf884009b16961ca478f87","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49622.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49622.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49622.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2022-49622","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49622.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-xf4c-frc6-wrrh/GHSA-xf4c-frc6-wrrh.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49622","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49622.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-59013.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b480544a-37cb-4796-a992-7500fbb34cbe.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0058","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49610","title":"Linux KVM VMX 返回栈缓冲区下溢漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 KVM 子系统的 VMX（虚拟机扩展）模块中，在虚拟机入口（vmenter）操作前进行 SPEC_CTRL 寄存器写入与 vmenter 之间存在平衡的返回指令序列。尽管平衡返回通常安全，但理论上深度调用栈的非屏蔽中断（NMI）可能在返回执行前耗尽返回栈缓冲区（RSB），导致 RSB 下溢。攻击者利用此漏洞可能引发基于推测执行的信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。开发者通过禁止在 SPEC_CTRL 写入与 vmenter 之间的任何返回操作来修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49610"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:37Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.14 及以上版本（适用于 5.18.x 稳定分支）或 5.19 及以上版本（主线），其中已通过 commit afd743f6dde8 修复 VMX vmenter 前 SPEC_CTRL 写入与 VM 进入之间的 RSB 下溢问题。使用 RHEL/CentOS 8/9、Ubuntu 20.04/22.04 LTS、Debian 11/12 等发行版的用户，请安装厂商提供的 linux-image 安全更新包并重启宿主机。如无法立即升级，可在 KVM 模块参数中设置 kvm.ignore_msrs=1 缓解侧信道风险，或在 BIOS 中关闭 Intel VT-x 功能禁用硬件虚拟化（将导致所有虚拟机无法运行）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/07853adc29a058c5fd143c14e5ac528448a72ed9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/afd743f6dde87296c6f3414706964c491bb85862","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49610.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49610.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49610","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49610.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49610.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-4w6c-74px-57rx/GHSA-4w6c-74px-57rx.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49610.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49610","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c740b2de-10ce-40c8-8806-c0269518a368.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49610.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0057","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49562","title":"Linux KVM 访客PTE A/D位更新内存越界访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 KVM 子系统的 x86 模块在处理客户机页表项（PTE）的访问/脏（A/D）位更新时存在缺陷。KVM 原本通过将客户机 PTE 映射到内核地址空间来更新 A/D 位，但 VM_PFNMAP 路径错误地假设 vm_pgoff 是映射 VMA 范围的基 PFN，这导致访问随机物理页帧号（PFN），可能造成敏感内存信息泄露。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞获取主机或其他虚拟机敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49562"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:27Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.13/5.18.2 或更高版本（5.19+ 已包含修复）。对于自定义内核编译环境，可通过 git cherry-pick 合入以下三个补丁之一：38b888911e8d（5.17-stable）、8089e5e1d184（5.18-stable）或 f122dfe44768（主线）。若无法立即升级，避免在 KVM 场景下使用 VM_PFNMAP 映射（如 /dev/mem 之外的后端内存）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/38b888911e8dc89b89d8147cfb1d2dbe6373bf78","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8089e5e1d18402fb8152d6b6815450a36fffa9b0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f122dfe4476890d60b8c679128cd2259ec96a24c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49562.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49562.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49562","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49562.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49562.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-xpvw-h2w8-vrf9/GHSA-xpvw-h2w8-vrf9.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49562.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49562","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68690.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--39410abf-e66c-49c2-b509-b42c28a25feb.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0056","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49552","title":"Linux Kernel BPF JIT盲化与子程序指针组合拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统中存在逻辑缺陷，当启用 JIT 随机化（blinding）功能且 BPF 程序中包含指向子程序的指针时，JIT 编译过程未正确识别 ld_imm64 这类特殊指令（其操作数非用户可控常量），导致对它们进行了不必要的随机化处理。此问题在首次 JIT 阶段触发后，使得后续 JIT 子程序阶段无法正确调整这些指令的地址引用，从而在内核态引发页面错误导致系统崩溃。本地攻击者可通过加载特制的 BPF 程序触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49552"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:25Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.13（5.17.x 分支）、5.18.2（5.18.x 分支）或 5.19 及以上版本，内核中已合入对应修复补丁（commit 4b6313cf99b0、a029b02b47dd、d106a3e96fca）。如无法立即升级，可关闭 BPF JIT 盲化功能作为临时缓解措施：将 `/proc/sys/net/core/bpf_jit_enable` 设为 0 并设置 `bpf_jit_harden=0`，但会导致 eBPF 性能下降。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4b6313cf99b0d51b49aeaea98ec76ca8161ecb80","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a029b02b47dd5bb87a21550d9d9a80cb4dd3f714","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d106a3e96fca30e44081eae9c27aab28fc132a46","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49552.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49552.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49552","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49552.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49552.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-hg9m-frc8-4qpx/GHSA-hg9m-frc8-4qpx.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49552.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49552","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68687.json","https://github.com/sfX-android/automation_scripts/blob/31ea3918bf444b85e03796e19b5377a53835812b/roles/axp/common/templates/cve_excludes/kernel_sony_sdm660.j2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0055","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49547","title":"Linux Kernel btrfs 并发直接 I/O 写入死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Btrfs 文件系统存在死锁漏洞，当多个直接 I/O 写入任务同时操作同一文件范围且空闲数据空间不足时，由于文件范围锁定与异步数据回收任务之间的循环等待，导致系统死锁。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 Btrfs 文件系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49547"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:24Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.18.3 及以上版本，该版本已合入 btrfs 并发 direct IO 写入死锁的修复补丁。若无法立即升级内核，可应用补丁 commit f5585f4f0ef5b17026bbd60fbff6fcc91b99d5bf（主线）或 cfae6f765b3c40882ee90dae8fbf9325c8de9c35（稳定分支）到对应内核源码后重新编译。临时缓解措施包括限制不可信用户的本地登录权限、避免在 btrfs 文件系统剩余空间不足时执行并发 direct IO 写入操作，以及监控内核 hung task 超时日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cfae6f765b3c40882ee90dae8fbf9325c8de9c35","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f5585f4f0ef5b17026bbd60fbff6fcc91b99d5bf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49547.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49547","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49547.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49547.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49547.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-85q7-hhcq-pr4h/GHSA-85q7-hhcq-pr4h.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49547","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49547.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58347.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4426df70-8238-4c2d-8102-f502a3468035.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0054","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49543","title":"Linux ath11k 驱动 MHI 电源管理 dev_wake 警告致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ath11k 无线驱动中存在设备唤醒状态管理缺陷。当通过写入 sysfs 接口模拟固件崩溃触发设备恢复流程时，MHI 总线电源管理状态机中的 `mhi_deassert_dev_wake()` 被调用，但对应的 `mhi_assert_dev_wake()` 因恢复期间 PM 状态非正常而被跳过，导致 `dev_wake` 计数器失衡，在 `mhi_pm_disable_transition()` 中触发内核告警。该漏洞影响 WCN6855 和 QCA6390 等 ath11k 无线芯片组，需本地攻击者具有触发固件崩溃的能力，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等，可能导致系统可用性受影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49543"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:23Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.17.14、5.18.3 或 5.19 及以上版本，其中已包含对 ath11k_pci_write32()/ath11k_pci_read32() 的补丁，可在设备恢复过程中避免因 dev_wake 计数不匹配导致的内核警告。如无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 ath11k 无线网卡驱动或阻止加载 ath11k_pci 内核模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0d7a8a6204ea9271f1d0a8c66a9fd2f54d2e3cbc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5f18206cddae033c488e4879f198699092ca0524","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2d9b7357469949ad02f511fc69f8fa3a1afbf89","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49543.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49543","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49543.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49543.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49543.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49543.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-p6c8-wm8r-hj4h/GHSA-p6c8-wm8r-hj4h.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-49543","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49543.json","https://github.com/Alexandre-gng/ANSSI_alerts/blob/70d44ad0e93bb331b572bd411ab72438068e6dba/data_pour_TD_final/first/CVE-2022-49543"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0053","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49535","title":"Linux kernel SCSI lpfc 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCSI lpfc 驱动中存在释放后使用漏洞，当 lpfc_issue_els_flogi() 函数执行 FLOGI 请求失败返回非零状态后，节点引用计数被递减以触发 nodelist 结构体释放。若此时存在待处理的 dev-loss-evt 任务，节点会被过早释放，当 dev-loss-evt 完成时引用已释放节点导致空指针解引用。类似地，在 PLOGI 处理中若 dev-loss-evt 待处理也存在相同问题。该漏洞影响使用 Emulex LightPulse FC 驱动的 Linux 系统，攻击者可通过触发特定 SCSI ELS 命令失败导致条件竞争，造成系统崩溃或权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49535"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:22Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.15.181（5.15 LTS 分支）、5.18.3 或 5.19 及以上版本，升级完成后重启系统使新内核生效。如无法立即升级，可通过 `sudo modprobe -r lpfc` 临时卸载 lpfc 驱动模块禁用 Emulex FC 适配器，但此操作将导致所有依赖该模块的光纤通道存储不可用，仅建议在非生产环境或冗余链路下作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/10663ebec0ad5c78493a0dd34c9ee4d73d7ca0df","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/577a942df3de2666f6947bdd3a5c9e8d30073424","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c7dc74ab7975c9b96284abfe4cca756d75fa4604","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49535.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49535.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49535.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49535","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49535.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-84hr-q2hc-2m5c/GHSA-84hr-q2hc-2m5c.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49535","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49535.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58986.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5fc355d60e5d1a1fefefacd0202b767223ed6ef1/usn/7712-1.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0052","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49534","title":"Linux Kernel SCSI lpfc 驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 lpfc（LightPulse Fibre Channel）SCSI 驱动程序中存在内存泄漏漏洞，当 NPIV（N_Port ID Virtualization）端口发送 PLOGI_RJT（端口登录拒绝）响应时，在 lpfc_ignore_els_cmpl() 和 lpfc_els_rsp_reject() 函数中未正确释放从 login_mbox 分配的内存，导致内存泄漏。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞通过反复触发特定 ELS 命令导致系统内存资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 lpfc 驱动且启用 NPIV 功能的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49534"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:22Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 5.15.61 及以上版本，或应用各长期维护分支的对应补丁：5.10.x ≥5.10.136、5.4.x ≥5.4.211、4.19.x ≥4.19.255。如无法更新内核，可在不影响业务的前提下卸载 lpfc 内核模块（modprobe -r lpfc）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/672d1cb40551ea9c95efad43ab6d45e4ab4e015f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c00df0f34a6d5e14da379f96ea67e501ce67b002","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49534.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49534.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49534.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49534","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49534.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-gv9g-ccx2-9xj9/GHSA-gv9g-ccx2-9xj9.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49534","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49534.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58352.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0530f23e-dc4a-4baf-be49-f94c68f899c7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0051","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49533","title":"Linux kernel ath11k 驱动缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ath11k 无线驱动存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。ath11k 驱动注册时报告最大支持 16 个 SSID 的主动探测请求，但 scan_req_params 结构体仅能容纳 10 个 SSID。本地攻击者可通过 wpa_supplicant 用户态程序触发 SSID 拷贝操作，导致越界写入覆盖 extraie 指针，造成缓冲区溢出。该漏洞影响使用 ath11k 驱动的 Qualcomm 平台设备，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49533"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:22Z","remediation":"升级包含提交 `373e4b709c7e` 的 Linux 内核版本（如 5.18+ 长期支持分支），将 ath11k 驱动中 `max_ssids` 和 `max_bssids` 分别设为 16 和 4 以匹配 firmware 实际容量。如无法立即更新内核，可在加载 ath11k 模块后通过 `iw wlan0 scan` 限制 userspace 扫描参数作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/210505788f1d243232e21ef660efcd4838890ce8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/50dc9ce9f80554a88e33b73c30851acf2be36ed3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ec5dfa1d66f2f71a48dab027d26a9fa78eb0f58f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49533.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49533.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49533.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49533","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49533.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-vw9q-9cr4-4qj5/GHSA-vw9q-9cr4-4qj5.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49533.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49533","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49533.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3c76deef-139d-473d-a1f4-c42f66922f01.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0049","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49529","title":"Linux AMDGPU 驱动 SMU 禁用时空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMDGPU 驱动中的电源管理模块存在空指针解引用漏洞，当软件 SMU（系统管理单元）未启用时，`pp_funcs` 函数指针未正确初始化。在释放上下文过程中，`amdgpu_dpm_force_performance_level` 函数直接访问该未初始化的指针，导致内核空指针解引用崩溃。本地攻击者可通过运行 `amdgpu_test` 或构造特定的 AMDGPU ioctl 调用触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响启用了 AMDGPU 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49529"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:21Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 5.16.19 及以上版本（包含提交 91b8e8e5 修复的稳定版本），或直接升级至 5.17 主线版本。可通过发行版包管理器安装最新稳定内核，或从 kernel.org 获取源码手动编译。如果无法立即升级内核，可卸载 amdgpu 驱动模块（`rmmod amdgpu`）并改用开源 vesa 驱动作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/49ec3441aa5e5940f3e82dd2f0205b9c856e399d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eea5c7b3390c6e006ba4cbd906447dd8cea8cfbf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49529.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49529","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49529.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49529.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49529.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-99w7-7m35-gf5v/GHSA-99w7-7m35-gf5v.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49529","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49529.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58344.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b3488347-96e1-4ad0-85c0-86f495fdc6f9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0048","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49528","title":"Linux 内核 dw9714 驱动资源释放不当漏洞","description":"Linux 内核媒体子系统 DW9714 镜头驱动（`drivers/media/i2c/dw9714.c`）在驱动探测失败时未正确关闭稳压器（regulator），导致 regulator 核心在资源释放时触发内核警告（WARNING），可能造成稳压器资源泄漏、功耗异常或后续驱动加载失败。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限及加载该驱动的条件才能触发此缺陷，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。开发者已在驱动探测失败的分支路径中补充 regulator 禁用逻辑修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49528"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:20Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit 98b0c0e0b15a 的版本（主线 5.18+、长期稳定 5.15.39+ / 5.10.119+），或在相应发行版安装对应内核安全更新。也可通过反向移植该补丁到自定义内核构建中。无法立即升级时，可卸载（blacklist）dw9714 内核模块（echo \"blacklist dw9714\" > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-dw9714.conf）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/02276e18defa2fccf16413b44440277d98c2b1ea","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fa83ea1de5b3efd87fe01408d5db1fd2ff4767fa","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49528.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49528.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49528.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49528","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49528.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-3f5c-xpwv-8wgm/GHSA-3f5c-xpwv-8wgm.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49528.html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49528.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2022-49528","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d9a33189-bca8-41cd-bcd4-c2e1ae8db39f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0047","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49516","title":"Linux 内核 ice 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ice 网卡驱动（Intel Ethernet 控制器驱动）中存在空指针解引用漏洞，ice_get_vf_vsi 函数在某些场景（如 VF 重置过程中 VSI 被移除并重建）可能返回 NULL 指针，但驱动中多处调用该函数后未检查返回值有效性，导致在特定执行路径下可触发空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版，本地攻击者可通过触发 VF 重置等操作利用此漏洞造成拒绝服务（系统崩溃）。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。修复方式为在所有调用点增加 ice_get_vf_vsi 返回值的有效性检查。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49516"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:17Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.18.3 或更高版本（补丁提交 e7be3877589d / baeb705fd6a7）。各发行版执行对应更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image 后重启；RHEL/CentOS 执行 yum update kernel 后重启；临时缓解措施可卸载 ice 驱动模块（rmmod ice）禁用 Intel VF 网卡直通功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/baeb705fd6a7245cc1fa69ed991a9cffdf44a174","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7be3877589d539c52e5d1d23a625f889b541b9d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49516.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49516.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49516.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49516","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49516.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-6246-v5x4-r68f/GHSA-6246-v5x4-r68f.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49516","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49516.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--328c2795-2b14-43f1-b361-ec0106e151f6.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-49516"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0046","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49504","title":"Linux kernel lpfc 驱动外部环回模式空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCSI lpfc 驱动程序中存在引用计数缺陷漏洞。当插入外部回环插头进行短时回环测试后拔出并接入正常目标线缆时，由于回环模式下发送的 FLOGI 请求被 ABTS 中止，但 ABTS 因地址无效被丢弃在链路上。回环测试完成后原本的 ABTS 完成事件引用已释放的 fabric ndlp，导致系统在 `lpfc_set_rrq_active()` 例程中发生内核崩溃（oops）。本地攻击者需物理接入目标设备并通过插拔回环插头触发此条件，造成拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49504"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.18.3 或更高版本（5.19+ 亦不受影响），对应补丁提交为 ead76d4c09b89f4c8d632648026a476a5a34fde8。如无法立即升级内核，可临时避免在运行 lpfc 驱动的 SCSI 设备上使用外部回环线缆测试后直接切换至直连目标设备，操作前确保 ABTS 超时完成以规避引用释放后重用的内核崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a1516930cb605caee3bc7b4f3b7994b88c0b8505","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ead76d4c09b89f4c8d632648026a476a5a34fde8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49504.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49504.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49504.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49504","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49504.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-2rh7-4r32-mrr5/GHSA-2rh7-4r32-mrr5.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49504.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49504","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49504.md","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68624.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0045","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49496","title":"Linux MediaTek 视频编解码器驱动模块卸载空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Mediatek 视频编解码器驱动（mtk-vcodec-dec）中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当驱动启用子设备（subdev）模式时，`mtk_vcodec_dec_remove` 函数中 `dev->pm.dev` 参数为空指针，在卸载模块（rmmod）时调用 `__pm_runtime_disable` 会触发空指针解引用，导致内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。本地攻击者可通过加载并卸载受影响驱动模块触发该漏洞。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49496"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:14Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.3 或更高版本，该版本已包含修复提交 c10c0086db68。如无法升级内核，可应用补丁：在 `drivers/media/platform/mediatek/vcodec/mtk_vcodec_dec_drv.c` 的 `pm_runtime_disable(dev->pm.dev)` 前添加 `if (!dev->vdec_pdata->is_subdev_supported)` 条件判断，避免在 subdev 模式下调用空指针。作为临时缓解措施，可禁止卸载 `mtk-vcodec-dec.ko` 模块（通过 `rmmod` 黑名单或模块锁定），减少触发崩溃的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1fa37b00dc55a061a3eb82e378849862b4aeca9d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c10c0086db688c95bb4e0e378e523818dff1551d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49496.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49496.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49496.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49496","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49496.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-p4v4-q7w4-pw4w/GHSA-p4v4-q7w4-pw4w.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49496","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--068d2dc5-00aa-473a-a23b-15323039a4c4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49496.json","https://github.com/jgamblin/CVEWG/blob/6b61147c983d05006ce255b73c38853628033450/Data/Data.ipynb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0045.toml"}]